#: includes/admin/views/discover.php:27
msgid ""
"A free, fast community theme for BuddyPress, BuddyBoss and PeepSo with a "
"modern layout and dark mode."
msgstr ""
"Un thème communautaire gratuit et rapide pour BuddyPress, BuddyBoss et "
"PeepSo avec une mise en page moderne et un mode sombre."

#: includes/admin/views/discover.php:33
msgid "A full social network for WordPress with feeds, profiles, and messaging."
msgstr ""
"Un réseau social complet pour WordPress avec des fils d'actualités, des "
"profils et la messagerie."

#: includes/admin/views/discover.php:39
msgid "Forums, Q&A, and idea spaces that scale and moderate themselves."
msgstr "Forums, Q&R et espaces d'idées qui s'adaptent et se modèrent eux-mêmes."

#: includes/admin/views/discover.php:45
msgid "Photo and video sharing with albums, reactions, and private chat."
msgstr "Partage de photos et vidéos avec des albums, des réactions et du chat privé."

#: includes/admin/views/discover.php:52
msgid "Run community events with RSVPs, calendars, and front-end submissions."
msgstr ""
"Gère les événements communautaires avec RSVPs, calendriers et soumissions "
"front-end."

#: includes/admin/views/discover.php:59
msgid ""
"Reward members with points, badges, and leaderboards to keep engagement "
"high."
msgstr ""
"Récompense les membres avec des points, des badges et des classements pour "
"maintenir l'engagement à un haut niveau."

#: includes/admin/views/discover.php:65
msgid "Searchable directories with reviews, maps, and member submissions."
msgstr "Répertoires consultables avec critiques, cartes et soumissions de membres."

#: includes/admin/views/discover.php:72
msgid ""
"Add a job board with front-end listings, applications, and employer "
"profiles."
msgstr ""
"Ajoute un tableau d'emploi avec des annonces front-end, des candidatures et "
"des profils d'employeurs."

#: includes/admin/views/discover.php:78
msgid "A free LMS to sell courses, run quizzes, and award certificates."
msgstr ""
"Un LMS gratuit pour vendre des cours, organiser des quiz et décerner des "
"certificats."

#: includes/admin/views/discover.php:85
msgid ""
"A free service marketplace with vendor dashboards, an 11-status order flow, "
"and Stripe or PayPal built in."
msgstr ""
"Une place de marché de services gratuite avec des tableaux de bord vendeur, "
"un flux de commandes à 11 statuts et Stripe ou PayPal intégrés."

#: includes/admin/views/discover.php:93
msgid "More Free Tools from Wbcom Designs"
msgstr "Plus d'outils gratuits de Wbcom Designs"

#: includes/admin/views/discover.php:94
msgid ""
"Birthday reminders keep members coming back. These free Wbcom Designs "
"plugins give your community more reasons to stay: the theme and network "
"itself, forums, media, events, gamification, directories, jobs, courses, "
"and services."
